	<item>
		<title>Free Range House Double Smoked Bacon (1kg)</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/free-range-house-double-smoked-bacon-1kg/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/free-range-house-double-smoked-bacon-1kg/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 01 Oct 2024 22:33:21 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=13642</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>House-smoked bacon offers an unbeatable depth of flavor, with a rich, smoky aroma that elevates every bite. Slowly smoked over natural wood, it boasts a perfect balance of savory, salty, and slightly sweet notes. Crisp yet tender, this bacon adds gourmet flair to any dish, from breakfast to burgers.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/free-range-house-double-smoked-bacon-1kg/">Free Range House Double Smoked Bacon (1kg)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/free-range-house-double-smoked-bacon-1kg/">Free Range House Double Smoked Bacon (1kg)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
