		<item>
		<title>Free Range Christmas Turkey</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/free-range-christmas-turkey/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/free-range-christmas-turkey/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 30 Sep 2024 01:28:18 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=13502</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Discover the exceptional quality of Free Range Turkey from WM Meats, where we pride ourselves on raising turkeys naturally, without the use of chemicals, hormones, or artificial additives. Our turkeys roam freely in open pastures, ensuring they grow healthy and strong, just as nature intended. Perfect for your holiday feast or special family meal, this turkey is tender, flavorful, and wholesome. At WM Meats, we’re committed to providing only the finest products for your table, so you can enjoy a delicious, stress-free meal that’s full of natural goodness. Taste the difference with our premium Free Range Turkey today!</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/free-range-christmas-turkey/">Free Range Christmas Turkey</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/free-range-christmas-turkey/">Free Range Christmas Turkey</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
