					<description><![CDATA[<p>Our Free-Range, Double-Smoked In-House Ham is a true holiday showstopper! Expertly double smoked over locally sourced Ironbark hardwood, this ham boasts a rich, smooth smoky flavor that’s second to none. It's the kind of ham that will have everyone coming back for seconds—perfect for your Christmas table!</p>
<ul>
<li>Free Range Pork</li>
<li>No Chemicals Added</li>
<li>Natural Smoke</li>
<li>Authentic Handcrafted Hams</li>
</ul>
